# Flight Control Computer (FCC) - Starship Telemetry Auditor
This repository contains the real-time critical telemetry processing subsystem matching **DO-178C Level A** avionics standards.

## Project Specifications
* **Standard:** MISRA C++:2008 / Hard Real-Time O(1)
* **Target:** Fixed-point math logic to prevent IEEE-754 scaling drifts.
* **Failsafe:** Auto-trips a structural abort if telemetry inputs are spoofed or physically impossible.